    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Shaped like a dome and strung like a spider web, the Orbit Climber gives a group of children a rope frame they can climb from any side. There is no fixed route. Children find their own path up the web, sit near the top and call to friends below, which turns climbing into a shared game. The rope gives slightly with each step, so they learn to balance as they go. The dome covers 10'4\" x 10'4\" and needs a square safe play area of 15'4\" x 15'4\". It comes in Ocean Grey, a calm colour that sits well among trees or lawns. Play rope and galvanised pipe are covered by our 3-year warranty. Ask for a layout drawing showing the dome on your site."
     }
    ]
   }
