  {
   "component": "ProductSpecifications2",
   "props": {
    "pText": "The Orbit Climber combines galvanised pipe with a play rope web, both under our 3-year warranty against manufacturing defects. We install it self-standing or grouted, depending on the ground. Keep the full 15'4\" x 15'4\" square clear on all four sides, since children climb off in every direction, and inspect the rope joints during maintenance.",
